<view class="income-page">
  <fullscreen-nav title="平台收入核账" tone="dark" testing-title-only="{{true}}" testing-badge-with-title="{{true}}"></fullscreen-nav>

  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="page-state"><text class="cuIcon-loading2 spin"></text>正在读取当前核账事项</view>

  <block wx:elif="{{stale}}">
    <view class="state-card">
      <text class="cuIcon-roundcheckfill state-icon"></text>
      <view class="state-title">当前无需核账</view>
      <view class="state-desc">该收入核账事项已被处理、订单状态已变化，或当前存在需要先处理的资金风险。请返回工作台查看最新状态。</view>
    </view>
  </block>

  <block wx:elif="{{task}}">
    <view class="summary-card">
      <view class="summary-label">订单</view>
      <view class="summary-value mono">{{id}}</view>
      <view class="summary-row"><text>当前平台应收</text><text class="money">¥{{dueText}}</text></view>
      <view class="summary-note">仅核实已经真实到账的全额平台收入款。部分到账、金额不一致、退款/争议/售后风险仍由专项财务流程处理。</view>
    </view>

    <view class="form-card">
      <view class="field">
        <view class="field-label">实际到账金额 <text class="required">*</text></view>
        <view class="money-input"><text>¥</text><input type="digit" value="{{confirmedAmount}}" bindinput="amountInput" placeholder="0.00" /></view>
        <view class="field-help">必须按实际流水填写；服务端要求与本单当前平台应收完全一致。</view>
      </view>

      <view class="field">
        <view class="field-label">银行/转账流水号 <text class="required">*</text></view>
        <input class="text-input" value="{{paymentReference}}" maxlength="120" bindinput="referenceInput" placeholder="填写真实交易单号或银行流水编号" />
        <view class="field-help">同一个外部流水号不能在多个平台订单重复登记。</view>
      </view>

      <view class="field">
        <view class="field-label">核验备注</view>
        <textarea class="note-input" value="{{note}}" maxlength="420" bindinput="noteInput" placeholder="可选：收款渠道、对账依据等"></textarea>
      </view>

      <checkbox-group bindchange="checkedChange">
        <label class="check-row">
          <checkbox value="confirmed" checked="{{receiptChecked}}" color="#00aebd"></checkbox>
          <view><view class="check-title">我已核对真实到账流水</view><view class="check-desc">不是聊天截图、口头确认或预计到账；提交后将按真实资金事实结清本单平台应收。</view></view>
        </label>
      </checkbox-group>
    </view>

    <view class="risk-note"><text class="cuIcon-warn"></text><view>若存在退款、争议、售后、预约费流水变化或流水号重复，服务端会拒绝本次核账，不会强制结清。</view></view>

    <button class="submit-button" bindtap="submit" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{submitting || !receiptChecked}}">确认真实到账</button>
  </block>
</view>